<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: GOLF-IRISH OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-IRISH OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
